sequenceDiagram
    participant Component
    participant FeatureErrorBoundary
    participant GlobalErrorBoundary
    participant Sentry
    participant UI
    participant User

    Component->>FeatureErrorBoundary: Throws Error
    FeatureErrorBoundary->>FeatureErrorBoundary: getDerivedStateFromError()
    FeatureErrorBoundary->>FeatureErrorBoundary: Set hasError state
    FeatureErrorBoundary->>Sentry: captureException(error)
    Sentry-->>FeatureErrorBoundary: Error ID
    FeatureErrorBoundary->>UI: Render FeatureErrorFallback
    UI->>User: Display error with retry button

    alt User clicks Retry
        User->>FeatureErrorBoundary: resetError()
        FeatureErrorBoundary->>Component: Re-render component
        alt Component Succeeds
            Component->>User: Normal rendering
        else Component Fails Again
            Component->>GlobalErrorBoundary: Error escalates
            GlobalErrorBoundary->>Sentry: captureException(error)
            GlobalErrorBoundary->>UI: Render GlobalErrorFallback
            UI->>User: Display critical error + Go Home
        end
    else User clicks Go Home
        User->>UI: Navigate to /
        UI->>User: Home page loads
    end
